# Code owners for the GitHub Copilot AI Credit Dashboard.
#
# Owners listed here are requested for review automatically when a matching
# path changes. The last matching pattern wins, so the security-sensitive
# entries below intentionally follow the catch-all rule.

* @robpitcher

# Authentication, authorization, billing access, and IssueOps logic carry the
# project's core security guarantees: self-scoped `/me` access, server-only
# credentials, fail-closed enterprise membership checks, and protected budget
# writes. Keep review on these paths explicit.
/src/lib/                       @robpitcher
/src/app/api/                   @robpitcher
/scripts/                       @robpitcher

# Workflow, action, and release configuration can change what runs with
# elevated permissions.
/.github/                       @robpitcher
/.github/workflows/             @robpitcher
/.github/actions/               @robpitcher

# Project governance, licensing, and security policy.
/LICENSE                        @robpitcher
/SECURITY.md                    @robpitcher
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md             @robpitcher
/.github/CODEOWNERS             @robpitcher
